      "description": "The text 'a good american' is positioned above the teacher, creating an analogical mapping where the teacher (visual entity) is being identified or represented as 'a good american' (textual entity). This mapping is based on the juxtaposition of the text with the visual of the teacher in the classroom, implying that the teacher embodies the concept of a 'good american' through his role in civic education or moral instruction.",
